flowchart TD
    accTitle: Billy end-to-end demo workflow
    accDescr: Target workflow. A company profile informs discovery. A previous response supplies evidence. Discussion closes gaps before a reviewed PDF and explicit delivery approval. Vultr hosts the workflow; NetBird protects reviewer access.
    A["Ask Billy + basic company profile"] --> B["Find and explain the Berkeley match"]
    subgraph V["Work runs on Vultr"]
      B --> C["Import previous response + cite evidence"]
      C --> D["Identify gaps + draft response"]
      D --> E["Discuss missing facts"]
      E --> F["Save facts, tasks + response edits"]
      F --> D
      D -->|Ready for review| P["Response PDF in chat"]
      P --> R["You review through protected access"]
      R -->|Request changes| E
      R -->|Approve exact version + destination| S["Billy executes test delivery"]
      S --> T["Record delivery result"]
    end
    N["NetBird: authenticated review access"] -.-> R
    classDef work fill:#e6ecdf,stroke:#8caa7c,color:#172b29
    classDef human fill:#176349,stroke:#176349,color:#ffffff
    classDef output fill:#fff6df,stroke:#c8ad6d,color:#172b29
    class B,C,D,F,S,N work
    class A,E,R human
    class P,T output
